"독립적으로","x":1283,"y":425,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"서브디","x":1457,"y":424,"width":90,"height":37}]},{"text":"렉터리에 저장될 수 있다. 두 프로그래머는 공동으로 그 프로젝트에 관여하므로 그 서브","words":[{"text":"렉터리에","x":305,"y":483,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"저장될","x":448,"y":483,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":554,"y":484,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":600,"y":483,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":681,"y":485,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"프로그래머는","x":724,"y":483,"width":184,"height":37},{"text":"공동으로","x":920,"y":485,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1059,"y":488,"width":31,"height":26},{"text":"프로젝트에","x":1102,"y":484,"width":156,"height":36},{"text":"관여하므로","x":1273,"y":485,"width":159,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1444,"y":490,"width":31,"height":25},{"text":"서브","x":1488,"y":484,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"디렉터리가 모두 자신의 디렉터리에 있기를 원한다. 따라서 그 공통 서브디렉터리는 공","words":[{"text":"디렉터리가","x":304,"y":543,"width":163,"height":36},{"text":"모두","x":480,"y":544,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"자신의","x":556,"y":542,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"디렉터리에","x":665,"y":543,"width":150,"height":37},{"text":"있기를","x":833,"y":544,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"원한다.","x":938,"y":544,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":1056,"y":544,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1162,"y":549,"width":30,"height":26},{"text":"공통","x":1206,"y":546,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"서브디렉터리는","x":1284,"y":545,"width":222,"height":38},{"text":"공","x":1519,"y":546,"width":32,"height":34}]},{"text":"유되이야 한다. 공유 디렉터리나 파일은 동시에 두 개 이상의 장소에 존재할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"유되이야","x":302,"y":603,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":445,"y":602,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"공유","x":529,"y":603,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리나","x":606,"y":603,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"파일은","x":771,"y":604,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"동시에","x":874,"y":604,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":979,"y":606,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"개","x":1024,"y":605,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"이상의","x":1066,"y":605,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"장소에","x":1170,"y":605,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"존재할","x":1274,"y":606,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1381,"y":607,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1426,"y":605,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"트리 구조는 파일 또는 디렉터리의 공유를 허용하지 않는다. 비순환 그래프(acyclic","words":[{"text":"트리","x":363,"y":663,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"구조는","x":441,"y":664,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":550,"y":662,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"또는","x":625,"y":665,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"디렉터리의","x":701,"y":664,"width":151,"height":37},{"text":"공유를","x":867,"y":665,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"허용하지","x":974,"y":664,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"않는다.","x":1112,"y":665,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"비순환","x":1229,"y":665,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"그래프(acyclic","x":1334,"y":665,"width":215,"height":43}]},{"text":"graph)는 디렉터리들이 서브디렉터리들과 파일들을 공유할 수 있도록 허용하는 구조","words":[{"text":"graph)는","x":301,"y":725,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"디렉터리들이","x":465,"y":723,"width":186,"height":37},{"text":"서브디렉터리들과","x":671,"y":723,"width":251,"height":37},{"text":"파일들을","x":936,"y":725,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"공유할","x":1077,"y":726,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1186,"y":727,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있도록","x":1235,"y":726,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"허용하는","x":1344,"y":727,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"구조","x":1484,"y":729,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"로(그림 13.10) 똑같은 파일이나 서브디렉터리가 서로 다른 서브디렉터리에 있을 수 있","words":[{"text":"로(그림","x":301,"y":784,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"13.10)","x":426,"y":786,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"똑같은","x":535,"y":784,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"파일이나","x":643,"y":784,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"서브디렉터리가","x":782,"y":784,"width":219,"height":36},{"text":"서로","x":1014,"y":785,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1090,"y":786,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"서브디렉터리에","x":1165,"y":786,"width":216,"height":3